Phase 2 — Game and Edition
Create the Edition entity.

Implement:
Game 1 -------- N Edition

Requirements:
 Use @OneToMany and @ManyToOne.
 A Game should be able to persist its Editions.
 Deleting a Game should delete its Editions.
 Removing an Edition from the Game's collection should delete it from the
database.

Use appropriate:
cascade = ...
orphanRemoval = true
Test the following:
Game
├── Standard Edition
├── Deluxe Edition
└── Ultimate Edition
Then remove one Edition from the collection and verify that it is deleted from
the database.